# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Licensed / redistribution-restricted microdata.
#
# We keep the CATALOG (data/catalog/*.csv — study lists, IDs, URLs) and the
# built (P,c,o,r) rows we are licensed to hold, but NOT raw source downloads.
#
# UKDS "safeguarded" data (Innovation Panel SN 6849, BES restricted files) is
# End-User-Licence only — NO redistribution. Keep it local; never commit it.
# Same for any source whose licence forbids redeposit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/
# Person profiles built from UKDS SN 6849. These ARE the licensed microdata,
# reshaped: one file per person, several hundred of their own survey answers
# each. Never committed. The scripts that build them live in scripts/ and carry
# no data; the worked example in EXAMPLE_FULL.md is one real person and is
# covered by this rule too.
data/profiles/
data/processed/*.parquet
data/processed/*.csv
!data/processed/.gitkeep

# Embedding vectors: an expensive-to-recompute INTERMEDIATE, not a result.
# ~24KB per text and unbounded, so it would bloat the repo for no gain. The
# result worth tracking is data/catalog/coverage_map.json, the 2D coordinates.
data/catalog/embeddings/
